      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, on March 7, 2020, New York State Governor Andrew Cuomo declared a State disaster emergency for the entire State of New York to address the threat that COVID-19 poses to the health and welfare of New York residents and visitors; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
