    {
      "bbox": [
        201,
        1636,
        1490,
        1826
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. In order to provide continued support to restaurants, bars and other establishments participating in the Open Restaurants program established by Emergency Executive Order No. 126, as amended by subsequent orders, and to allow such establishments to continue outdoor dining operations during the colder weather months, I hereby authorize such establishments to utilize temporary outdoor heaters in their outdoor dining areas.",
